    "long_instructions": "## Write Your Styling Prompt\r\n\r\n**Your Task:** Before using AI to generate your stylesheet, write a detailed prompt that explains how your website should be styled. Your prompt must clearly answer the following three questions:\r\n\r\n1. What is the goal?\r\n> What should your website look and feel like after styling? What mood or tone should it communicate?\r\n2. What are the constraints?\r\n> What brand colors and fonts must be used?\r\n>\r\n> Which sections must be styled consistently (header, nav, main content, footer)?\r\n>\r\n> Are there any readability or usability requirements?\r\n3. What are the edge cases?\r\n> What styling problems should be avoided?\r\n>\r\n> - For example: low contrast text, hard-to-read fonts, inconsistent spacing, etc.",
